  <activity label="arraylistDuplicatesParsons" numbered="yes" adaptive="yes" indentation="show" language="java">
    <statement>
      <p>
        The following program segment is a method that should return true if
        there are any duplicate elements in an ArrayList of Integers (the
        parameter). But, the blocks have been mixed up and include extra blocks
        that are not needed in a correct solution. Drag the needed blocks from
        the left and put them in the correct order on the right. Click the Check
        button to check your solution.
      </p>
